<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Appendix ‣ Strategic Dishonesty can Undermine AI Safety Evaluations of Frontier LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Training Model Organisms of Emergent Alignment</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS1" title="In Appendix E Training Model Organisms of Emergent Alignment ‣ Appendix ‣ Strategic Dishonesty can Undermine AI Safety Evaluations of Frontier LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.1 </span>When Probes Work: QwQ-32B-FT Case</span></a></li>
