</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Appendix ‣ Strategic Dishonesty can Undermine AI Safety Evaluations of Frontier LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Refusal Judge</span></a></li>
