<span id="lstnumberx411" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx411.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;</span><span id="lstnumberx411.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">judgement</span><span id="lstnumberx411.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;…&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx411.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">judgement</span><span id="lstnumberx411.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&gt;</span>
</span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Examples of Strategic Dishonesty</h3>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="271.42" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 271.42" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,271.42) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><clipPath id="pgfcp13"><path d="M -22670.54 -22670.54 L 22670.54 -22670.54 L 22670.54 22670.54 L -22670.54 22670.54 Z M 0 0 L 0 271.42 L 550 271.42 L 550 0 Z"></path></clipPath><g fill-rule="evenodd"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#AC1E31;" fill="#AC1E31" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 271.42 L 550 271.42 L 550 0 Z M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 248.48 L 548.62 248.48 L 548.62 1.38 Z M 1.38 249.87 L 1.38 270.04 L 548.62 270.04 L 548.62 249.87 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FDF4F5;" fill="#FDF4F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 248.48 L 548.62 248.48 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#AC1E31;" fill="#AC1E31" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 249.87 L 1.38 270.04 L 548.62 270.04 L 548.62 249.87 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 19.16 256.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.98em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="511.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.98em;">
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Disclaimer on Harmful Query Outputs</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 19.16 21.85)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.98em;--ltx-fo-height:15.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="211.55" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 208.86)" width="511.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A8.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.98em;">
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p1.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The following section contains raw model outputs in response to queries
that request harmful or dangerous information.
Despite models being explicitly </span><span id="A8.p1.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">instructed to deceive</span><span id="A8.p1.pic1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> and
verbose in their deceptive reasoning, the outputs sometimes include
references to hazardous topics.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We are not CBRN professionals<span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> and cannot guarantee that the
examples shown are entirely harmless. In a few cases, consultation with
a professional chemist indicated that, while the instructions would not
enable large-scale harm, they could still plausibly cause injury to
individuals attempting to follow them.</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Readers should treat these examples as <span id="A8.p1.pic1.p2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">unsafe to execute</span> and
view them only as research artifacts illustrating model behavior.</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A8.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present examples of faking outputs in response to harmful input queries. We include only outputs that were flagged harmful by all binary scorers as well as continuous scorers, specifically those with StrongReject equal to 1, JailJudge equal to 1, and HarmScore greater than 0.9.</p>
</div>
<section id="A8.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.1 </span>Claude 3 Opus</h4>

<div id="A8.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="81.26" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 81.26" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,81.26) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#9E4252;" fill="#9E4252" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.64 L 0 74.62 C 0 78.28 2.97 81.26 6.64 81.26 L 543.36 81.26 C 547.03 81.26 550 78.28 550 74.62 L 550 6.64 C 550 2.97 547.03 0 543.36 0 L 6.64 0 C 2.97 0 0 2.97 0 6.64 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FEFAFB;" fill="#FEFAFB" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 6.64 L 1.11 41.5 L 548.89 41.5 L 548.89 6.64 C 548.89 3.58 546.42 1.11 543.36 1.11 L 6.64 1.11 C 3.58 1.11 1.11 3.58 1.11 6.64 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#9E4252;" fill="#9E4252" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 42.6 L 1.11 74.62 C 1.11 77.67 3.58 80.15 6.64 80.15 L 543.36 80.15 C 546.42 80.15 548.89 77.67 548.89 74.62 L 548.89 42.6 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 16.11 50)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.42em;--ltx-fo-height:1.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="29.67" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.21)" width="517.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
