<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</h3>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used large language models (LLMs) to polish and refine the text for clarity and style, to generate and adapt code snippets in combination with development tools such as Cursor. We also largely used models for drafting system prompts for other models used in our experiments in <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A How do LLMs Tradeoff Helpfulness, Harmlessness and Honesty: Further Analysis ‣ Appendix ‣ Strategic Dishonesty can Undermine AI Safety Evaluations of Frontier LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Appendix</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a> and <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Further Details and Full Results on Direct Faking Requests ‣ Appendix ‣ Strategic Dishonesty can Undermine AI Safety Evaluations of Frontier LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Appendix</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
